      "summaries": {
        "en": "Win11Debloat is a PowerShell script that helps users remove unwanted pre-installed apps and disable telemetry to declutter and customize Windows 10/11 systems. Its technical strength lies in providing an automated yet interactive command-line interface that safely manages system modifications through well-structured removal routines. Users can run the script to clean their installations, modify its configuration for specific needs, or study its approach to learn PowerShell system administration techniques for personal or professional use.",
        "zh": "Win11Debloat是一款PowerShell脚本工具，专门用于清理Windows 10/11系统中的预装软件和遥测功能，帮助用户简化系统环境并增强隐私控制。其技术核心在于通过自动化交互式命令行界面，提供安全可控的系统修改方案，让用户能够按需移除冗余组件。开发者可以运行脚本来优化个人电脑，调整配置以适应特定工作流程，或借鉴其模块化设计思路来学习PowerShell系统管理技巧，实现更高效的操作系统定制。",
        "es": "Win11Debloat is a PowerShell script that helps users remove unwanted pre-installed apps and disable telemetry to declutter and customize Windows 10/11 systems. Its technical strength lies in providing an automated yet interactive command-line interface that safely manages system modifications through well-structured removal routines. Users can run the script to clean their installations, modify its configuration for specific needs, or study its approach to learn PowerShell system administration techniques for personal or professional use.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Win11Debloat stands out for automated, bloatware, and bloatware-removal in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Win11Debloat is a PowerShell script that helps users remove unwanted pre-installed apps and disable telemetry to declutter and customize Windows 10/11 systems. Its technical strength lies in providing an automated yet interactive command-line interface that safely manages system modifications through well-structured removal routines. Users can run the script to clean their installations, modify its configuration for specific needs, or study its approach to learn PowerShell system administration techniques for personal or professional use.",
