      "summaries": {
        "en": "BettaFish is an open-source multi-agent framework for public opinion analysis that helps users break through information bubbles by collecting diverse perspectives. Its technical innovation lies in using specialized AI agents—each trained for distinct tasks like sentiment detection and trend prediction—to collaboratively analyze data without relying on external frameworks. Researchers can deploy it to monitor social media discussions, journalists might use it to track emerging narratives, and developers can extend its agent architecture for custom analysis pipelines.",
        "zh": "BettaFish是一个开源的多智能体舆情分析框架，旨在通过整合多元信息源帮助用户突破信息茧房，还原舆论全貌。其核心设计采用分工协作的AI智能体架构，每个智能体专门处理情感分析、趋势预测等特定任务，无需依赖外部框架即可实现深度分析。该工具适合研究人员监测社交媒体动态、记者追踪热点事件演变，开发者也可基于其模块化设计构建定制化的舆情分析流程，为决策提供数据支持。",
        "es": "BettaFish is an open-source multi-agent framework for public opinion analysis that helps users break through information bubbles by collecting diverse perspectives. Its technical innovation lies in using specialized AI agents—each trained for distinct tasks like sentiment detection and trend prediction—to collaboratively analyze data without relying on external frameworks. Researchers can deploy it to monitor social media discussions, journalists might use it to track emerging narratives, and developers can extend its agent architecture for custom analysis pipelines.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "BettaFish stands out for agent-framework, data-analysis, and deep-research in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "BettaFish is an open-source multi-agent framework for public opinion analysis that helps users break through information bubbles by collecting diverse perspectives. Its technical innovation lies in using specialized AI agents—each trained for distinct tasks like sentiment detection and trend prediction—to collaboratively analyze data without relying on external frameworks. Researchers can deploy it to monitor social media discussions, journalists might use it to track emerging narratives, and developers can extend its agent architecture for custom analysis pipelines.",
