        "zh": "Kimi-K2.5是一个多模态对话AI模型，能够同时处理图像和文本输入，生成连贯的响应，解决了传统模型在视觉与语言结合任务中的局限性。它采用Transformer架构，通过压缩张量技术高效整合视觉和文本特征，实现了跨模态信息的流畅交互。开发者可通过Hugging Face平台直接调用，应用于视觉问答、智能助手等场景，支持自定义代码进行微调，适合探索多模态AI的实际应用。",
        "es": "Kimi-K2.5 is a multimodal conversational AI model that processes both images and text to generate coherent responses, addressing the need for more natural human-AI interactions. It employs a transformer architecture with compressed tensor techniques to efficiently handle visual and textual data simultaneously. Developers can use it through Hugging Face's pipeline API for applications like visual question answering, accessible via the model hub with custom code support for fine-tuning.",
